---
import LessonLayout from '../../../layouts/LessonLayout.astro';
---
<LessonLayout title="Workbook &mdash; Confirmation" cic="CCC 1285-1321" scripture="">

<section class="content">

<h2>Student Workbook</h2>
<p class="big-question">For use after class or in groups. Print this page or work in your notebook.</p>

<h3>Remembering the Essentials</h3>

<ol>
<li>What does the word "Confirmation" mean in the sacramental context?</li>
<li>What is the relationship between Baptism and Confirmation?</li>
<li>Who is the ordinary minister of Confirmation and why?</li>
<li>What gifts are received in Confirmation?</li>
<li>What essential rite of Confirmation expresses the seal of the Holy Spirit?</li>
</ol>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>For Reflection and Writing</h3>

<p>Answer each question honestly. There are no "correct" answers in these personal questions.</p>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">1. What does it mean to you to be "confirmed" in faith? Do you feel confirmed, or is it something you are still discovering?</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">2. Of the seven gifts of the Holy Spirit, which do you feel you need most in this moment of your life?</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">3. Do you remember your Confirmation? What was most significant for you?</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">4. Confirmation sends you into the world as a witness. In what area of your life (family, school, work, friends) is it hardest to be a witness for Christ?</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content" id="activities">

<h3>Practical Activities</h3>

<h4>A. The Seven Gifts of the Holy Spirit</h4>
<p>Write each gift and next to it a concrete situation in your life where you need it:</p>
<p>Wisdom: _______________ &nbsp; Understanding: _______________</p>
<p>Counsel: _______________ &nbsp; Fortitude: _______________</p>
<p>Knowledge: _______________ &nbsp; Piety: _______________</p>
<p>Fear of the Lord: _______________</p>

<h4>B. Interview a Confirmed Person</h4>
<p>Ask someone who received Confirmation: What changed in your life after Confirmation? Write their response.</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Scripture to Memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>"Receive the Holy Spirit. If you forgive the sins of any, they are forgiven them."</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; John 20:22-23</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Come, Holy Spirit,<br />
fill the hearts of Your faithful,<br />
and kindle in them the fire of Your love.<br />
Send forth Your Spirit and they shall be created,<br />
and You shall renew the face of the earth.<br />
O God, who by the light of the Holy Spirit<br />
did instruct the hearts of the faithful,<br />
grant that by the same Holy Spirit<br />
we may be truly wise<br />
and ever rejoice in His consolation.<br />
Through Christ our Lord.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

</section>

